WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.000
朋友把整份海报推过来：“今晚你全帮我改完吧？”
A friend pushes over the whole poster: “Could you redo it all tonight?”

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.900
把你今天的时间摊开。已经安排好的事占了大半。
Lay out today’s time. Existing plans already take most of it.

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:19.000
你愿意帮忙，也只空得出二十分钟。
You want to help and have twenty minutes available.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:24.800
“今晚整份我接不了。我有二十分钟，可以一起检查开头。”
“I can’t take the whole poster tonight. I have twenty minutes to review the opening.”

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:29.000
把能做的范围和条件说具体，对方才知道怎样安排。
Naming the scope and conditions lets the other person plan.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:33.600
有余地时，可以协商范围、时间或者分工。
When there is room, negotiate scope, timing, or who does what.

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:39.000
只有你愿意并且做得到的部分，才放进承诺。
Commit to the part you can and want to do.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:48.000
如果对方继续施压或让你不安全，可以结束谈话，找可信任的成人支持。
If pressure continues or you feel unsafe, leave the conversation and ask a trusted adult for support.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:56.000
边界把你能承担的部分说清楚，也给接下来怎么合作留出空间。
A boundary clarifies what you can take on and leaves room for collaboration.
